@page "/components/pagination"

<PageTitle>Pagination — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Pagination</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    Links, not buttons: a page is a URL, so it can be shared, opened in a tab and reached by the
    back button. A click handler gives you none of the three.
</p>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Basic</h2>
<Example Source="PaginationExample.razor"><PaginationExample /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Simple</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    Numbers and nothing else. For a list short enough to show every page, an arrow is a control
    that says less than the number beside it.
</p>
<Example Source="PaginationSimple.razor"><PaginationSimple /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Icons Only</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    A table footer: rows-per-page on one side, the two arrows on the other.
    <code>mx-0 w-auto</code> is what stops the nav centring itself — here it is one half of a row
    rather than the whole width. The arrows keep their names, because an arrow announced as
    "button" is a button nobody can identify in a list of them.
</p>
<Example Source="PaginationIconsOnly.razor"><PaginationIconsOnly /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Next.js</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    shadcn's section here swaps the anchor for a router <code>Link</code>. There is no router: it
    is an <code>&lt;a href&gt;</code> and Unpoly follows it. <code>up-target</code> swaps only the
    list, so the page keeps its scroll and the filters above it are untouched, and
    <code>up-preload</code> fetches the next page on hover — which on a list people page through
    is most of the perceived speed.
</p>
<Example Source="PaginationRouter.razor"><PaginationRouter /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">RTL</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    Translated, not merely mirrored: Arabic labels and Arabic-Indic digits, which is what upstream
    shows. The arrows flip by themselves — "previous" is a direction in the reading order rather
    than on the screen, and rotating them again at the call site is how that gets got wrong twice.
</p>
<Example Source="PaginationRtl.razor"><PaginationRtl /></Example>
